====Usage notes====
{{unreferenced}}
The term {{term/t|sh|Sȑbin}} denotes an ethnic Serb, while the term {{term/t|sh|Srbijánac}} has a complex meaning since it is sometimes considered derogatory, and the terms {{term/t|sh|Sȑbin}} and {{term/t|sh|Sȑpkinja}} should be used instead.

